1
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,500
[keyboard clacking]

2
00:01:03,500 --> 00:01:06,320
PRIYA: I'm in. Their firewall is
older than my laptop.

3
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:11,020
VICTOR: Don't get cocky. Copy the
ledger and get out.

4
00:01:14,020 --> 00:01:18,520
PRIYA: Victor, these aren't bank
records. These are names. Journalists, activists.

5
00:01:20,520 --> 00:01:24,360
VICTOR: Not our concern. The client
pays for the file, not our opinions.

6
00:01:27,360 --> 00:01:29,640
PRIYA: Someone is going to hurt these people.

7
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:35,300
VICTOR: Priya, in this business,
silence is the only code we live by.

8
00:01:44,300 --> 00:01:45,800
[phone buzzing]

9
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:51,280
PRIYA: You sold me out. The client
knew my location before I did.

10
00:01:54,280 --> 00:01:57,280
VICTOR: I protected you for ten
years. This was the price.

11
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:04,140
PRIYA: Then I'll pay it differently.
I'm sending the list to every newsroom in the city.

12
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:09,540
VICTOR: If you do that, you'll
never work again.

13
00:02:11,540 --> 00:02:13,640
PRIYA: Good. I'm done living by your code.

14
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,140
<i>Upload complete.</i>

15
00:02:21,140 --> 00:02:23,480
VICTOR: You were always the best
student I had.

16
00:02:25,480 --> 00:02:29,020
PRIYA: We're not done yet, Victor.
Now it's your name on the list.

17
00:02:31,020 --> 00:02:34,020
